+
+Autofix round 1 (implementer): `KeypadEdgeReach.swift`, `KeypadScreenEdgesModifier.swift`, `ScreenOcclusionsModifier.swift`, `EnvironmentValuesExtension.swift`, `KeypadEdgeReachTests.swift`. Build ✅ · tests ✅ · SwiftLint ✅ · archtest ✅. Re-verify: clean.
+
+## Verification
+
+Round 1, agent on simulators (DeviceHub posture/rotate, pixel diffs vs pre-#66 build dd7a7dd):
