+- ✅ iPhone 18 Pro portrait unchanged.
+- ⬜ Not run: Duo closed landscape camera top-left, Duo closed portrait launch, iPhone landscape both rotations — run: yours. (Prototype with the same logic showed top-left → left 14 pt, iPhone → asymmetric.)
+
+## Feedback
+
+### Round 1 · 2026-11-08
+
+Asked:
+- launch on closed Duo portrait jumps (safe area first, ignored 0.2 s later)
+- closed landscape camera top-left: status line looks offset, should ignore horizontal safe area
+- closed landscape camera bottom-right: keypad should go above the camera, full width
